### Scoring Agent - Score CV against Jobs
POST http://localhost:8080/scoring-agent
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
  "cv": "John Doe\nSoftware Engineer with 5 years experience\nSkills: Java, Spring Boot, Python, AWS, Docker\nEducation: BS Computer Science",
  "jobs": "Job 1: Senior Java Developer - Required: Java, Spring, Microservices, 5+ years experience\nJob 2: Python Developer - Required: Python, Django, Machine Learning, 3+ years experience"
}

